# Craft KB — index

Look up a technique by bucket. **M** = master card (merges 2+ videos; values compared side by side). Otherwise the link is the
single source card. `use when` = the episode moment it serves. ⚠ = the card carries a house-rule adaptation — read its `style_fit` first.

Contents: [Animation & motion](#animation--motion) · [Geometry Nodes](#geometry-nodes) · [Modeling & modifiers](#modeling--modifiers) · [Shading & lighting](#shading--lighting) · [Camera, composition & raea pipeline](#camera-composition--raea-pipeline)

